<title>USA: Martin Marietta buys sand, gravel facility.</title>
<headline>Martin Marietta buys sand, gravel facility.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Marietta Materials Inc said on Monday it bought a sand and gravel operation in Martinsville, Ind., with production capacity exceeding 500,000 tons per year.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said it has operated the facility under a lease since 1991. The purchase will help increase production capacity and reduce production costs at the location, Martin Marietta Materials said.</p>
